==English==

===Etymology===
Prefix ''[[pan-]]'' (from {{etyl|el}} {{term|πᾶς|sc=polytonic|tr=pas}}, {{term|πάντα|sc=polytonic|tr=panta||all}}) and "tropical" (from {{etyl|el}} {{term|τροπικός|sc=polytonic|tr=tropikos}}).

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Occurring in [[tropical]] areas on all the major [[continents]], i.e. in Africa, Asia and America, in 'all' the tropical regions. Used in biology, pertaining to area of geographical occurrence.

